Font metrics
------------
The bundled text-metric table (src/main/resources/metrics/segoe-ui-metrics.txt)
contains character advance widths generated from locally installed Segoe UI
faces; the font files themselves are not distributed. Segoe UI is a trademark
of Microsoft Corporation. This project is not affiliated with Microsoft.

This is an original implementation; no third-party source files are included.
It uses publicly available libraries under their own licenses, including
picocli, Apache XmlSchema 2 and Apache Batik (all Apache License 2.0) and
JUnit 5 (Eclipse Public License 2.0, test scope only).
